    "title": "Makeup Salon: Makeover ASMR",
    "description": "\ud83d\udc87 Are you a big fan of makeover, makeup, skincare or nail ASMR videos? \r\n\ud83d\udc85 Does ASMR sounds make you extremely relaxed? \r\n\r\nNow with our game \"Makeup Salon: Makeover ASMR\", you can double relax and enjoy satisfying realistic ASMR while playing. Come to this salon, be a beauty master and dive into the realistic makeover & makeup spa and enjoy relaxing ASMR sound today! It's so realistic as videos you watched about ASMR Mukbang or ASMR Skincare \ud83d\udc95. . \r\n\r\nThis makeup & makeover salon's mission is to help clients who wish to transform into a more beautiful version and give them the confidence to follow their dreams! Squeeze acne and hear a realistic sound by helping girls even boys to solve the problems of acne, uneven skin tone, and dullness on their face, makeup with tons of different cosmetics to create the fashion makeup. Always be gentle and careful with the client's skin trauma problems, such as broken nails, painful infections, fractures, wounds, germs and various abrasions. Finally, choose from lots of fashionable clothes and items to create the perfect look! \r\n\r\nHOW TO PLAY\r\n\ud83d\udc85 Use different specialized beauty tools like nail files, acne stick, scissors, botox to handle customer problems of skin, hair or nail\r\n\ud83d\udc84 Apply makeup to the customers with the best cosmetics you think.\r\n\ud83d\udc8d Choose and match the most beautiful jewelry, giving the customer a perfect look.\r\n\r\nGAME FEATURES\r\n\ud83d\udc57 Idle game with relaxing and satisfying ASMR sound effects like the ASMR skincare or ASMR Mukbang videos.\r\n\ud83d\udc60 Stress relieving on leisure time with relaxing ASMR sound effect and eye-catchy graphic\r\n\ud83d\udc52 Addictive and smoothing gameplay will make you addicted\r\n\ud83d\udc5f Realistic beauty tools and beauty domestic to makeup and makeover create the totally new and perfect fashion makeup.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\ude0d So if you are a addicted to makeover, makeup, nail or skincare ASMR video, then this is an amazing game for you. Don't hesitate anymore. Download this fashion game \"Makeup Salon: Makeover ASMR\" then become a master makeup and makeover expert rightnow!",
    "descriptionHTML": "\ud83d\udc87 Are you a big fan of makeover, makeup, skincare or nail ASMR videos? <br>\ud83d\udc85 Does ASMR sounds make you extremely relaxed? <br><br>Now with our game &quot;Makeup Salon: Makeover ASMR&quot;, you can double relax and enjoy satisfying realistic ASMR while playing. Come to this salon, be a beauty master and dive into the realistic makeover &amp; makeup spa and enjoy relaxing ASMR sound today! It&#39;s so realistic as videos you watched about ASMR Mukbang or ASMR Skincare \ud83d\udc95. . <br><br>This makeup &amp; makeover salon&#39;s mission is to help clients who wish to transform into a more beautiful version and give them the confidence to follow their dreams! Squeeze acne and hear a realistic sound by helping girls even boys to solve the problems of acne, uneven skin tone, and dullness on their face, makeup with tons of different cosmetics to create the fashion makeup. Always be gentle and careful with the client&#39;s skin trauma problems, such as broken nails, painful infections, fractures, wounds, germs and various abrasions. Finally, choose from lots of fashionable clothes and items to create the perfect look! <br><br>HOW TO PLAY<br>\ud83d\udc85 Use different specialized beauty tools like nail files, acne stick, scissors, botox to handle customer problems of skin, hair or nail<br>\ud83d\udc84 Apply makeup to the customers with the best cosmetics you think.<br>\ud83d\udc8d Choose and match the most beautiful jewelry, giving the customer a perfect look.<br><br>GAME FEATURES<br>\ud83d\udc57 Idle game with relaxing and satisfying ASMR sound effects like the ASMR skincare or ASMR Mukbang videos.<br>\ud83d\udc60 Stress relieving on leisure time with relaxing ASMR sound effect and eye-catchy graphic<br>\ud83d\udc52 Addictive and smoothing gameplay will make you addicted<br>\ud83d\udc5f Realistic beauty tools and beauty domestic to makeup and makeover create the totally new and perfect fashion makeup.<br><br>\ud83d\ude0d So if